<item><title>CVsky adds flights to clear passengers disrupted by medical evacuations</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/cvsky-adds-flights-to-clear-passengers-disrupted-by-medical-d8c968/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/cvsky-adds-flights-to-clear-passengers-disrupted-by-medical-d8c968/</guid><category>Cabo Verde</category><description>The airline says about 92% of roughly 1,060 affected passengers were regularised by Friday, 20 November, after medical flights took priority.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 18:33:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cv.jpg" length="34079" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cv.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Cape Verde&apos;s election commission proclaims Neves re-elected president</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/cape-verde-s-election-commission-proclaims-neves-re-elected-976fc1/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/cape-verde-s-election-commission-proclaims-neves-re-elected-976fc1/</guid><category>Cabo Verde</category><description>José Maria Neves won 63.96% of valid votes in the 15 November election, while turnout was the lowest on record for a presidential vote.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 14:49:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/cape-verde-s-election-commission-proclaims-neves-re-elected-976fc1/share.jpg" length="41011" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/cape-verde-s-election-commission-proclaims-neves-re-elected-976fc1/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Opinion: Cape Verde&apos;s trade fair shows activity but little urgency for change</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/opinion-cape-verde-s-trade-fair-shows-activity-but-little-8ab2c1/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/opinion-cape-verde-s-trade-fair-shows-activity-but-little-8ab2c1/</guid><category>Cabo Verde</category><description>Hélio Africano Varela, writing for Mindel Insite, says visitors to São Vicente&apos;s international trade fair found businesses at work but few new products or ways of working.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 11:23:09 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cv.jpg" length="34079" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cv.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Lusophone University of Cape Verde awards Germano Almeida honorary doctorate</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/lusophone-university-of-cape-verde-awards-germano-almeida-2bcfc6/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/lusophone-university-of-cape-verde-awards-germano-almeida-2bcfc6/</guid><category>Cabo Verde</category><description>The novelist says Cape Verdean literature should preserve the people&apos;s memory while reflecting the country&apos;s changes and achievements.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 10:03:49 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cv.jpg" length="34079" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cv.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Cape Verde joins six states in submitting climate plans to the UN</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/cape-verde-joins-six-states-in-submitting-climate-plans-to-587fc4/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/cape-verde-joins-six-states-in-submitting-climate-plans-to-587fc4/</guid><category>Cabo Verde</category><description>The seven Portuguese-speaking countries account for 2,62% of global emissions, while Cape Verde faces frequent droughts and irregular rain.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 09:12:47 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cv.jpg" length="34079" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cv.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
